#: .\templates\authors\index.html:44
msgid ""
"Mainly interested in bioinformatics, neurodegenerative diseases and genetics "
"with a growing interest in programming linked to biology and medicine."
msgstr ""
"Principalmente interessado em biominformática, doenças neurodegenerativas e "
"genéticacom interesse em programação ligada à biologia e medicina"

#: .\templates\authors\index.html:57
